    "Details": "The G configuration is focused on medium range engagements with its two Streak SRM-6 and four ER Medium Laser.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.01</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
