  "StockRole": "Sniper",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Adder came out of Clan Star Adder, built to emulate and beat the Inner Sphere designs they'd learned about from the Dragoons, and Trials of Possession spread it across most of the Clans by 3045. It's a light OmniMech with an Endo Steel chassis, an XL engine and ferro-fibrous armor, and it carries firepower that rivals Inner Sphere 'Mechs twice its weight. Most configurations are direct or indirect fire support, so it hits hard from range, but at thirty-five tons it can't take the beating the bigger machines it outguns can.",
